# Heavy shield knight (HKNIGHT): 91x64, 5-wide 12-row sheet. idle 0-4, walk 15-19, attack 10-14, block 30-34, death 55-59; extra swing and bash rows left out.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet hknight.ppm
cell 91 64

bank HKNIGHT
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : lin 0-4
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : lin 15-19
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : lin 10-14
seq BLOCK  loop ticks=4 : lin 30-34
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : lin 55-59
